title: "Which-instrument TPB replication package"
message: "If you use this code or gold-standard file, please cite the working paper and this software release."
type: software
license: MIT
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-09-10"
url: "https://github.com/occbuu/which-instrument-tpb"
