identifiers:
  - type: doi
    value: "10.5281/zenodo.22693743"
    description: "Zenodo archive of this replication package"
abstract: >
  Replication package for a human-anchored adjudication of dictionary,
  encoder, NLI and zero-shot LLM measures of the same text constructs.
  Includes analysis code, manuscript tables, de-identified error excerpts,
  and a text-free gold frame (N = 532) with salted document IDs.
keywords:
  - construct validity
  - dictionary methods
  - zero-shot classification
  - inter-coder reliability
  - large language models
  - online reviews
  - theory of planned behaviour
